            "detailed_description": "This is a VR game about traditional Chinese mythology. In the game, you will act as a theurgy practicer and train yourself by fighting against the Evil force until you reached the final stage of becoming immortal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2>Now, there are two stage of story mode you can play. Go ahead and pick up your sword to fight against the Evil force.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guide</h2>【Sword】Swing your right arm (handle) to fly your sword and attack targets when the target is highlighted.<br>【Shield】Protect you from short-range and long-range attacks. It doesn’t work for Bosses.<br>【Crystal】Casting spells will cost crystal. You can have at most 10 pieces of crystal. It shows at your right wrist.<br>【Flame】Directional skill, press “up” button on right handle to cast, cost 3 pieces of crystal.<br>【Freeze】Directional skill, press “down” button on right handle to cast, cost 3 pieces of crystal.<br>【Meteorite】Targeting skill, press “left” button on right handle to cast, cost 5 pieces of crystal.<br>【Sealing】AOE skill, press “right” button on right handle and draw the given shape to cast, cost 10 pieces of crystal.<br>【Move】Use trackpad on left handle.<br>【Collect】Touch the item by using left or right handle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expectation</h2>We will read every single opinion and suggestion you make for us. Please enjoy the game.<br>QQ group: <strong>387103581</strong><br>Both English and Chinese speakers, feel free to join us.",
