                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its a neat little demo. Didnt play much aside from one of the levels i somehow got myself into by clicking random selections. The combat is fun but repetitive and theres like 3 enemy types. The splash screen and title at the start leads me to believe this was a mobile game turned VR game and im surprised by how much work they put into it. Unfortunately i cant read chinese and it seems like that was the only demo area. \nStill if you have 20 minutes to kill you could do worse. At least its fun to look at your floating sword",
